{
  "name": "Voice Receptionist 3/3 - Scheduled Ops (Retry Queue + Reminders)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "dd5dfb39-da7b-4423-89bc-44afe771c645",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -240,
        -360
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 1000,
        "height": 300,
        "content": "## Voice Receptionist 3/3 - Scheduled Ops\n**Branch A (every 10 min):** retries `Pending_Bookings` created when the calendar was down. Success -> event created + SMS confirmation + row confirmed. 3 failures -> **HITL** email to staff (approve = staff will call the customer, decline = close request), customer is notified.\n**Branch B (hourly):** sends reminders ~24h before voice-booked appointments (SMS, email fallback), then marks the event as reminded so it never double-sends.\n\n**Setup:** Sheet tab `Pending_Bookings` headers: requestId, createdAt, status, attempts, name, phone, email, service, start, end, notes, callId, lastError. Update the calendar ID / timezone constants in the Code nodes."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "716701a7-d074-42c0-b8b6-ce2976c6d338",
      "name": "Every 10 Minutes",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        0,
        200
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "minutes",
              "minutesInterval": 10
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "7d6ae756-eb9f-4a75-9ccb-7da9f149fb3b",
      "name": "Read Pending Bookings",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.5,
      "position": [
        240,
        200
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "sheet",
        "operation": "read",
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "id",
          "value": "REPLACE_WITH_SHEET_ID"
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "name",
          "value": "Pending_Bookings"
        },
        "filtersUI": {
          "values": [
            {
              "lookupColumn": "status",
              "lookupValue": "pending"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "credentials": {
        "googleSheetsOAuth2Api": {
          "id": "REPLACE",
          "name": "Google Sheets account"
        }
      },
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput",
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 3,
      "waitBetweenTries": 3000,
      "alwaysOutputData": false
    },
    {
      "id": "97fdb441-9ed5-418d-afe2-fbbbbcc4142b",
      "name": "Prepare Retry",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        480,
        200
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "\nconst CAL_ID = 'primary', TZ = 'America/New_York';   // <-- match workflow 1 config\nfunction hid(s) { let h1 = 5381, h2 = 52711; for (const c of s) { h1 = ((h1 * 33) ^ c.charCodeAt(0)) >>> 0; h2 = ((h2 * 31) + c.charCodeAt(0)) >>> 0; } return 'vap' + h1.toString(16) + h2.toString(16); }\nreturn $input.all().map(i => {\n  const r = i.json;\n  const body = { summary: `${r.service} - ${r.name}`, description: `Booked by AI receptionist (recovered from request queue).\\nPhone: ${r.phone}\\nNotes: ${r.notes || ''}`,\n    start: { dateTime: r.start, timeZone: TZ }, end: { dateTime: r.end, timeZone: TZ }, attendees: r.email ? [{ email: r.email }] : undefined,\n    extendedProperties: { private: { phone: String(r.phone || '').replace(/\\D/g, ''), name: r.name, service: r.service, email: r.email || '', callId: r.callId || '', source: 'voice-ai' } },\n    id: hid(`${r.callId}|${r.start}|${String(r.phone || '').replace(/\\D/g, '')}`) };\n  const label = DateTime.fromISO(r.start, { zone: TZ }).toFormat(\"cccc, LLLL d 'at' h:mm a\");\n  return { json: { row: r, calendarId: CAL_ID, eventBody: body, label } };\n});\n"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "4e3057d8-1107-4b62-9324-c6a29a8513be",
      "name": "GCal - Create Event (retry)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        720,
        200
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "=https://www.googleapis.com/calendar/v3/calendars/{{ encodeURIComponent($json.calendarId) }}/events?sendUpdates=all",
        "authentication": "predefinedCredentialType",
        "nodeCredentialType": "googleCalendarOAuth2Api",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 15000
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify($json.eventBody) }}"
      },
      "credentials": {
        "googleCalendarOAuth2Api": {
          "id": "REPLACE",
          "name": "Google Calendar account"
        }
      },
      "onError": "continueErrorOutput",
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 2,
      "waitBetweenTries": 3000
    },
    {
      "id": "314ad996-ec4b-49cc-bc0a-5628a10610a6",
      "name": "Make Confirmed Row",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        960,
        100
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "\nconst p = $('Prepare Retry').item.json;\nreturn { json: { requestId: p.row.requestId, status: 'confirmed', attempts: Number(p.row.attempts || 0) + 1, lastError: '' } };\n",
        "mode": "runOnceForEachItem"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "00c7320b-91b1-4933-9091-eaede3d2c787",
      "name": "Mark Confirmed",
